Subject: [PATCH] Fix audit 85163d96: consent only for same-origin, decided
 before budget; notice for browsers without Fetch Metadata; spend malformed
 codes; revoke on reuse; no payment button for owned cosmetic

Narrow fixes only; the login design is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
